  "_comment_literal": [
    "`literal` cases exercise the first layer: `secret` (segments) is registered in a redaction set under",
    "`kind`; `in` may then use {\"ref\": F} segments where F is raw | base64 | base64url | rawbase64 | query |",
    "line:N (the Nth line of a multi-line secret) | line-base64:N. After redaction no form of the secret",
    "(and no line of 8+ chars) may survive, and «redacted:<kind>» must appear. These shapes match no pattern."
  ],
  "literal": [
    {
      "name": "inside a sentence",
      "kind": "gitea-token",
      "secret": [
        {
          "repeat": "q7Zm",
          "times": 4
        }
      ],
      "in": [
        "the runner said ",
        {
          "ref": "raw"
